Moreover, we know that

\Rightarrow \quad \begin{aligned}
\frac{2 \pi}{\lambda} & =\mathrm{k}=\pi \times 10^{-2} \mathrm{~m}^{-1} \\
\Rightarrow \quad \lambda & =200 \mathrm{~m}
\end{aligned}

